Helm commands:

helm repo add <repo-name> <repo-url>: Add a new chart repository.

helm repo update: Update your local repo cache.

helm search repo <chart-name>: Search for charts in your added repositories.

helm install <release-name> <chart> [flags]: Install a chart as a new release.

helm list: List installed releases.

helm upgrade <release-name> <chart> [flags]: Upgrade an existing release.

helm uninstall <release-name>: Uninstall a release.

helm get all <release-name>: Get all information about a release.

helm sync

helm template


